WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.738
Clone the repository and start the Playground

2
00:00:06.788 --> 00:00:13.738
1. Set the goal

3
00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:20.738
2. Define the workflow

4
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:27.738
3. Brainstorm ideas

5
00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:34.738
4. Collect the numbers

6
00:00:34.788 --> 00:00:41.738
5. Check it on a map

7
00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:48.738
6. Write the proposal

8
00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:55.738
7. Design the page

9
00:00:55.788 --> 00:01:02.738
8. Make the design mock

10
00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:03.783
The Playground is running. Next, plan a new café store with AI

11
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:10.963
AI writes the goal and deliverables as a Document (fictional data)

12
00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:16.273
A person reads it through

13
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:24.913
AI lays out the workflow as a Structured Graph

14
00:01:24.963 --> 00:01:32.203
A person renames step 4 to “check the candidate sites on a map”

15
00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:40.847
AI places sticky notes for location, customers and experience

16
00:01:40.897 --> 00:01:50.347
A person adds a note and groups it under “location”

17
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:58.490
AI tabulates sales for the 8 existing stores

18
00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:07.310
A person checks it as a chart and saves a version

19
00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:14.494
AI prepares map inputs: prefecture borders, stores, candidate sites

20
00:02:14.544 --> 00:02:25.856
Import prefecture borders and color each prefecture

21
00:02:25.906 --> 00:02:48.352
Import the store and candidate locations

22
00:02:48.402 --> 00:03:02.636
Join stores to Data sales by store ID and size circles by sales

23
00:03:02.686 --> 00:03:07.466
Candidate B sits between the strong eastern stores

24
00:03:07.609 --> 00:03:16.354
AI drafts the proposal outline as a Slide deck

25
00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:37.764
Embed the map and the sales table on slide 3 as linked references

26
00:03:37.814 --> 00:03:44.184
Kawabe’s sales were mistyped. Fix 150 to 450 in Data and save

27
00:03:44.234 --> 00:03:59.755
Geo notices the newer Data version; adopt it and save

28
00:03:59.805 --> 00:04:07.416
Back in the proposal, the map and table show the corrected sales

29
00:04:07.543 --> 00:04:16.123
AI writes the introduction page design as a Document

30
00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:20.873
A person adds the publishing date to the purpose

31
00:04:20.943 --> 00:04:29.503
AI builds the page mock in Design from the plan

32
00:04:29.553 --> 00:04:43.183
A person recolors the button and tries the prototype
